   22| #   4  15        fold    exponent_bias              PORTED (the fp8_fnuz arm too)
   23| #   5  16        fold    exponent_mask              PORTED
   24| #   6  19        fold    shr                        PORTED, the UOp arm DEAD
   25| #   7  20        fold    shl                        PORTED, the UOp arm DEAD
   26| #   8  22-25     fold    rintk                      PORTED IN FULL
   27| #   9  27-30     fold    pow2if                     PORTED IN FULL
   28| #  10  32-37     fold    ilogb2k                    PORTED IN FULL
   29| #  11  39-45     fold    ldexp3k                    PORTED IN FULL
   30| #  12  47-50     fold    ldexp2k                    PORTED IN FULL
  ... cited lines ...
     91| #    float16 both have `bits == 16` and mantissas 7 and 10. It is a TABLE, and
