    2| #
    3| # ===========================================================================
    4| # WHAT IS HERE, WHAT IS NOT, AND WHY NEITHER IS A SECOND COPY
    5| # ===========================================================================
    6| # `renderer/tc_ptx.bend` already ports ptx.py's EMITTERS -- `render_val`, the
