### tinybendygrad/uop/render.bend  (3120 lines)
    1| # render.bend -- tinygrad/uop/render.py.
    2| #
    3| # THE FIRST STRING-BUILDING UNIT IN THE PORT. Everything ported so far was DATA:
    4| # an arena of U32 indices, a fold of derived properties, six rule tables. This
